QUESTION: In the 2024 Grand Prix race laps, pair each pit-in lap with the next lap's pit-out time to get each stop's pit-lane time. Ignore stops under 10 seconds or over 60 seconds. For each team, give the median pit-lane time and the number of stops. Which team had the fastest median?
== run 1 ==
  step 1 SQL: SELECT
  pit_in.Team AS team,
  median((pit_out.PitOutTime - pit_in.PitInTime)/1e9) AS median_pit_time,
  count(*) AS stops
FROM
  laps AS pit_in
JOIN
  laps AS pit_out
  ON pit_in.Driver = pit_out.Driver
  AND pit_in.race = pit_out.race
  AND pit_in.session = 'R'
  AND pit_out.session = 'R'
  AND pit_out.LapNumber = pit_in.LapNumber + 1
WHERE
  pit_in.PitInTime IS NOT NULL
  AND pit_out.PitOutTime IS NOT NULL
  AND (pit_out.PitOutTime - pit_in.PitInTime)/1e9 BETWEEN 10 AND 60
GROUP BY pit_in.Team
ORDER BY median_pit_time ASC;
