steps=1 ANSWER: "**Median pit‑lane times (2024 race season)**  \n\n| Team | Median pit‑lane time (s) | Number of stops |\n|------|--------------------------|-----------------|\n| McLaren | **22.887** | 77 |\n| Mercedes | 22.908 | 78 |\n| Red Bull Racing | 22.928 | 80 |\n| RB | 22.940 | 72 |\n| Ferrari | 23.091 | 75 |\n| Alpine | 23.205 | 71 |\n| Aston Martin | 23.265 | 81 |\n| Williams | 23.545 | 72 |\n| Haas F1 Team | 24.010 | 85 |\n| Kick Sauber | 24.256 | 78 |\n\n**Fastest median**  \nThe team with the lowest median pit‑lane time is **McLaren** (22.887 s)."
